;; §9, the standard axioms are Init's own (kernel/test/session_test.shard; found 2026-11-12 by
;; slice 4.6 landing 2's review): a root loaded with no export, where no name of Init is known
;; to be taken. The module `Quot` declares an axiom `sound` — by its name a standard axiom, by
;; its origin the load's own declaration — and the policy places it outside
(axiom sound () Prop)
